  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why does this happen",
      "char_file": "면도기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Repeated irritation makes skin",
        "produce extra melanin",
        "",
        "as a defense response -",
        "the same reaction that",
        "darkens a healing scrape"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shaving with a Dull Blade",
      "char_file": "면도기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Tugging against the grain",
        "irritates the hair follicle",
        "",
        "Repeated over time,",
        "that irritation builds",
        "into visible pigmentation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instead of a dull blade",
      "char_file": "면도기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Switch to a sharp,",
        "single-blade razor",
        "",
        "and shave",
        "with the grain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fragrance & Dye",
      "char_file": "데오드란트_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Fragrance and dyes irritate",
        "freshly shaved skin",
        "",
        "especially when applied",
        "right after shaving"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instead of scented deodorant",
      "char_file": "데오드란트_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Pick a fragrance-free,",
        "dye-free deodorant",
        "",
        "Give your skin a few minutes",
        "before applying after shaving"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tight Workout Gear",
      "char_file": "스포츠브라_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sports bras and compression tanks",
        "trap sweat",
        "",
        "and rub the same spot",
        "during every workout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instead of tight gear",
      "char_file": "스포츠브라_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Choose looser,",
        "moisture-wicking fabric",
        "when you can",
        "",
        "and shower soon",
        "after your workout"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "None of this means",
        "you have to quit shaving or working out"
      ],
      [
        "But small swaps in your routine",
        "make a real difference"
      ]
